DESCRIPTION:Join a Park Ranger for a morning canoe paddle on our 12-acre la
 ke. Learn the basics of canoeing\, why boating safety is important\, and w
 hat makes our lake special. While there is no swimming portion during this
  program\, you will likely get splashed\, so be sure to wear appropriate c
 lothing. Bring water and sunscreen. This program is for everyone\, however
 \, anyone 15 years old and younger must be accompanied by an adult. Regist
 ration is required and there is limited space – please email Jackson.per
 ry@ncparks.gov to register. This program is weather dependent.
GEO:36.395044;-80.266541
LOCATION:Hanging Rock State Park\, Lake Bathhouse
