DESCRIPTION:Come hear The Velvet Beat and their energetic blend of jump blu
 es\, swing\, soul\, classic R&amp\;B\, and reimagined favorites that will 
 have you out of your seats and boogyng. Drawing inspiration from artists l
 ike Louis Jordan\, Cab Calloway\, Wilson Pickett\, Van Morrison\, and Dr. 
 John\, their repertoire spans five decades of music.\n\nThis and all shows
  in the Live @ATC series are free\, open to the public\, and all are welco
 me (kids included!).\n\nBring a lawn chair or blanket\, grab a beverage an
 d food from one of the ATC restaurants\, and enjoy!  
