DESCRIPTION:History is on the menu — and in the glass — at Bottleship: 
 History Served Neat\, a new signature fundraiser of the Battleship North C
 arolina Memorial on Friday\, October 2\, 2026\, at 6:30 p.m.\n\nHeld in th
 e Battleship’s Wardroom\, Bottleship will take guests through the storie
 s of three historic ships named USS North Carolina\, three eras\, and thre
 e historic rum cocktails for an evening that mixes maritime history\, food
 \, a little spirited storytelling\, and\, of course\, rum.\n\nGuests will 
 enjoy a catered Southern barbecue dinner\, one signature rum cocktail and 
 a “spirited” talk with Smuggler Mac. Those who want to have a little e
 xtra fun with the evening are also invited to dress the part of their favo
 rite era.\n\nThe event is open to guests ages 21 and older.\n\nTickets are
  a $75 donation per person and include:\n\nA “spirited” rum talk with 
 Smuggler MacCatered Southern barbecue dinnerOne signature cocktailTwo addi
 tional historic cocktails per person may be purchased for $12 each.\n\nPre
 sented in partnership with the Friends of the Battleship North Carolina an
 d Four Hounds Distilling\, proceeds from Bottleship support the growth and
  preservation of the Battleship’s World War II collection.
GEO:34.236158;-77.953643
LOCATION: Battleship North Carolina\, Wardroom
SUMMARY:Bottleship: History Served Neat 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/bottleship-history-served-ne
 at
