DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T103000
SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, NCMA 
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**September is National Yoga Month\, a
 nd I welcome you to join us outdoors\, in nature\, for a slower vinyasa fl
 ow to yin** **practice** ending in savasana. **ALL LEVELS and those new to
  yoga welcome!** Join our community and meet other like-minded people!\n\n
 *Rain date\, if needed\, will be Sunday\, Sept. 6 at 9am.*\nFOR ALL THOSE 
 THAT HAVE REQUESTED A SUNDAY MORNING YOGA IN NATURE CLASS!!! Practice viny
 asa flow yoga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors near upper parkin
 g area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, as there are other 
 groups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PARKING LOT\, DRIVE 
 TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY FROM THE MUSEUM. W
 e practice in the grass Ellipse area:)\n$15/person\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-G
 enander (0862)\nPaypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\n\nPlease bring your yog
 a mat or large towel\, water\, sunscreen and insect repellent (if you use)
 . Optional: a plastic reusable liner for under your mat (to protect it if 
 ground is wet/damp) or towel.
