SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050324Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T150000
SUMMARY:Walk & Brew: Move-A-Bull City ☕🚶🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nDurham is kicking cars off the stree
 ts for an afternoon\, so naturally we’re going for a walk… with bevera
 ge breaks.\n\nJoin us Sunday\, October 4\, for a special Walk & Brew at Mo
 ve-A-Bull City! The event turns 1.2 miles of downtown streets into a car-f
 ree celebration\, with music\, art\, food\, and activities along the way. 
 The festival runs noon–4 p.m.\n\nThe plan\n\nWe’ll start at Cocoa Cinn
 amon on Geer Street\, grab a coffee\, and meet the crew before heading out
 . We’ll walk down through the event along Foster\, Corcoran\, and Blackw
 ell\, check out whatever catches our attention\, then make our way back—
 with a couple of stops for drinks or a bite along the way.\n\nThink casual
  wandering\, good conversation\, and discovering things together\, rather 
 than a power walk or a tightly scheduled bar crawl. We’ll keep the stops
  flexible so we can enjoy the event as we go.\n\nCome solo or bring a frie
 nd. Beer\, coffee\, or just the walk—all are welcome. Drinking is option
 al\; getting out of the house and meeting some people is the point. 😄\n
 \n📍 Meeting spot: Outside Cocoa Cinnamon\, 420 W. Geer Street\, Durham.
 \n\n👟 Bring: Comfortable shoes\, water\, and money for any food or drin
 ks.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31674
 2800/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260928T010825Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T010825Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
