DESCRIPTION:Join us for Leave No Trace Discovery Hike\, a guided walk throu
 gh the scenic Holly Discovery trail of Lake James State Park. This family
 ‑friendly program introduces visitors to the seven Leave No Trace princi
 ples through simple\, hands‑on examples along the trail. As we explore\,
  you’ll learn practical ways to minimize impact and help protect Lake Ja
 mes for future generations. It’s an inspiring blend of outdoor adventure
  and stewardship\, perfect for hikers of all experience levels who want to
  enjoy the park while keeping it beautiful.
