DESCRIPTION:The Village of Pinehurst will be displaying two of the NC Depar
 tment of Natural & Cultural Resources exhibits throughout 2026.\n\n"Forgin
 g a Nation" will be on display at the Cannon Park Community Center\, 210 R
 attlesnake Trail\, Pinehurst\, NC 28374.\n\n"People of Colonial North Caro
 lina" will be on display at Assembly Hall\, 395 Magnolia Rd.\, Pinehurst\,
  NC 28374.\n\nThe Given Memorial Library & Tufts Archives (150 Cherokee Ro
 ad\, Pinehurst\, NC 28374) will also have smaller versions of the exhibits
  on display throughout the year and will rotate between the different exhi
 bit subjects periodically.
