X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Mobilization Mondays: Durham/Dacian Nation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261005T173000
DTSTAMP:20261003T050313Z
UID:dn2g099r7f03h5k5mu5ipkub80@google.com__20261005
SEQUENCE:2
CREATED:20260108T021652Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join Engaged Defenders for Democracy and Dacian Nation 
 every Monday at Dacian Avenue and Washington Street in Durham from 4:30-5:
 30pm.  There is convenient parking.\n\nThis will be a POSITIVE and nonviol
 ent demonstration. We are here to protect our democracy. We are standing u
 p for what we believe in. We want to inspire people to join us and grow ou
 r movement!\n\nPlease bring positive signs supporting the movement and res
 isting what is happening in our country!\n\nPlease no mocking signs\, no s
 wastikas\n\nWe are excited to see you there and stand together for our cou
