 gy.\nIn general\, discussion will cover inpatient and outpatient problems
 \, with an emphasis on including primary radiographic data\, clinical lab
 oratory results and pathology specimens for review. Several recent articl
 es relevant to the discussion will be presented with each case\, with an 
 emphasis on recent research (clinical\, translational and basic).
