SUMMARY:The Ultimate after work bike ride\, slightly earlier on the ATT
DESCRIPTION:Triangle Hiking and Outdoors Group\nWe'll be starting near Sou
 thpoint and final starting point will be sent out Monday evening.\n\nMake 
 sure that your bike is in good working order - tires hold air and are up t
 o pressure\, brakes and shifters work and your chain has been oiled.\nThe 
 end of the season is fast approaching. We'll be riding just over 1 hour an
 d about 12 miles. The ride is fairly flat and shaded and our pace will be 
 moderate (about 12 mph average). I recommend a hard tail or hybrid bike\, 
 but if you really want to bring a road bike it's ok\, though you'll likely
  be a bit bored. Unicycles....?\n\nI'll be eating after the ride at a rest
 aurant. You're welcome to join me if you like.\n\nHelmets are required and
  by signing up you agree to THOG liability waiver statement.\n\nPlease Not
 e!! Any cancellation less than 30 hours before the beginning of the event 
 will be considered a "no show"
