DTSTAMP:20261003T050336Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53695051761329
DTSTART:20261006T230000Z
DTEND:20261007T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Do you love Haw River State Park and want to show your support 
 of this special place? \n\nJoin neighbors\, nature lovers\, and community 
 leaders for the first Friends of Haw River State Park interest meeting —
  an opportunity to help shape the future of one of North Carolina's most b
 eloved State Parks. This welcoming session will introduce the vision for a
  Friends group dedicated to supporting Haw River State Park through volunt
 eer stewardship\, educational programming\, event support\, fundraising\, 
 and more. Attendees will hear from park staff about the benefits to the pa
 rk and community of a strong Friends group\, learn about the many ways vol
 unteers can get involved\, and participate in an open discussion about nex
 t steps.\n\nWhether you are a longtime park visitor\, an educator looking 
 for partnership opportunities\, a volunteer with trail maintenance experie
 nce\, or someone who wants to give back to your community\, we need you! M
 eet fellow advocates and leave with concrete ways to contribute — from o
 ne-time event help to much-needed leadership roles in our Friends chapter.
 \n\nPlease register through the Registration link to help us with planning
 . If you can't make this meeting but still want to recieve updates or get 
 involved\, please select the E-mailing List option under Registration to c
 onnect with our volunteer program coordinator. Together we can strengthen 
 our community connections and protect the Haw River for generations to com
 e. We hope to see you there!
GEO:36.250909;-79.756467
LOCATION:Haw River State Park\, "The Round Building" at The Summit
SUMMARY:Friends of Haw River State Park Interest Meeting
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/friends-of-haw-river-state-p
 ark-interest-meeting
