 unding Hammocks Beach State Park. This ranger-led excursion will help you 
 identify wading birds\, shorebirds\, raptors\, and seasonal migrants while
  exploring some of the area's premier birding locations. Bring your binocu
 lars and curiosity as we search for feathered residents and visitors that 
 depend on our estuarine habitats. Limited to 11 participants\; sign-up is 
 required. To register\, you must come to the Visitor Center to sign-up.
