BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_b32e7018b18e1a8650f0d178e5d8314fd6664c368233eead570b44e368f882c9
SUMMARY:Team ENOUGH Welcome Session (For Young People Under 26)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T190000
DTSTAMP:20261003T050314Z
UID:4p63pqtfdgrvtanku69db847pq@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T180000
SEQUENCE:0
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260101T202106Z
DESCRIPTION:Link to join: https://www.mobilize.us/join/46980100/1:1dc71a75
 b92b26539de741acd434350f9871ce0b04985d779a1e3c453462d896/\n\nHow to join:\
 nPlease join our virtual welcome session with this link\n\nAre you a young
  person between 13 and 25 years old who is interested in taking action aro
 und preventing gun violence? Join us for our Team ENOUGH welcome session t
 o learn more about the different ways you can engage. \n\nTeam ENOUGH is a
  youth-led program whose mission is to educate young voices about gun viol
 ence and mobilize them to take meaningful action against it. Supported by 
 Brady United\, we harness the expertise and experience of today’s youth 
 to advance our intersectional work across the country. \n\nLed by an Execu
 tive Council\, comprised of students just like us\, we believe that divers
 ity is a strength\, and that only when everyone has a seat at the table ca
 n we build an effective movement to prevent all gun violence in all commun
 ities.\n\nFor us\, preventing gun violence not only requires regulating ac
 cess to firearms but also addressing how systemic racism and environmental
  factors cause this form of bloodshed to run especially rampant in communi
 ties of color. You cannot talk about gun violence without talking about po
 lice brutality\, white supremacy\, the broken criminal justice system\, po
 verty\, homophobia\, access to affordable housing\, or the often barriers 
 separating disadvantaged populations from physical and mental healthcare. 
 \n\nSo if you share this belief\, join us for our Team ENOUGH welcome sess
 ion and become part of the movement to end gun violence in our lifetime.\n
 \nHow to prepare:\nWe are excited to see you soon!\n\nP.S. This is a call 
 for young people from 13-25 years old who are interested in getting engage
 d with the Team ENOUGH program. If you are over the age of 25 please sign 
 up for the Brady Welcome Session at https://www.mobilize.us/brady/event/27
 4016/\n\nEvent Zoom Link: https://us06web.zoom.us/j/84862510973\n\nhttps:/
 /www.mobilize.us/brady/event/425528/
LAST-MODIFIED:20260101T202106Z
LOCATION:Virtual event
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (Virtual US)
END:VEVENT
