DESCRIPTION:Think you're an expert on North Carolina history\, geography\, 
 and culture? Here's your chance to show off your skills in North Carolina 
 Trivia\, brought to you by the State Archives of North Carolina and the Li
 brary of North Carolina.\n\nOn Wednesday\, October 14\, 2026 at 7 pm\, pla
 yers can participate—individually or in teams—at the Transfer Co. Food
  Hall as we present fascinating trivia about the Old North State. Bragging
  rights are on the line in this Carolina contest of wits! We look forward 
 to seeing you there. No registration is required.
