DTSTAMP:20261003T050336Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53886984980405
DTSTART:20261017T140000Z
DTEND:20261017T160000Z
DESCRIPTION:This volunteer opportunity is part of Outer Banks Volunteer Wee
 k (October 10-17\, 2026)\n\nJoin the Friends of Jockey's Ridge at Jockey's
  Ridge State Park for a marine debris cleanup and beach sweep at the Sound
 side beach access. Jockey's Ridge State Park Ranger Austin Paul will lead 
 this volunteer opportunity alongside other environmental stewards of the p
 ark. Help us protect the tallest active sand dune system on the east coast
 .\n\nWhere to Park:\nPlease park at the Jockeys' Ridge State Park Soundsid
 e Beach Access at 330 W. Soundside Road\, Nags Head\nWhere to Meet: \nRang
 er Austin Paul will meet all volunteers at the Soundside Beach Access park
 ing lot.\nWhat to Bring: Please be prepared with sunscreen as needed and w
 ater for hydration. If weather allows\, some marine debris cleanup time wi
 ll be spent in the shallow water of the sound.\n\nDetails\n\nTeam Size: 2 
 - 20 members per team\n\nRegister by Oct 15\, 2026\n\nFor additonal detail
 s and to register please visti https://www.volunteerobx.com/need/detail/?n
 eed_id=1301710
