BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_41d85e1478a55e3b4adbf2e4951c5be9f6e49241ac55a65427c71d252849bf1c
SUMMARY:Triangle Unified Bridge Brigade: 3rd Saturday of the month
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T143000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T160000
DTSTAMP:20261003T050313Z
UID:4b2equ44ou22rr0m1ntpvnfjcf@google.com__20261017
SEQUENCE:3
CREATED:20260108T022208Z
DESCRIPTION:Come join Engaged Defenders for Democracy as we partner with t
 he Overpass Coalition to have a Unified Bridge Brigade that covers bridges
  in the Triangle and beyond on the third Saturday of the month. We will ha
 ve protectors on multiple bridges to show that we are not going away\, we 
 are not backing down\, and we support our neighbors and workers. We also a
 re uniting all of us over billionaires.\n\nWe will have message about peac
 e\, unity\, and defending our Constitution.\n\nWe will host a Visibility B
 rigade event where drivers see our protectors and signs as they drive unde
 r overpasses in Durham\, Raleigh\, Cary\, Pittsboro\, and Chapel Hill. (we
  are coordinating with 10 other states).\n\nPlease use the SignUp Genius t
 o sign up for the bridge you will attend: \n\n<a href="https://www.google.
 com/url?q=https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C0549A5AA23A1F8C43-61318184-cu
 ltivating%23/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw37H
 WRXd8toiUx9B8XiYVXn" target="_blank">https://www.signupgenius.com/go/10C05
 49A5AA23A1F8C43-61318184-cultivating#/</a> \n\nEven in cooler temperatures
 \, sunburn and dehydration can be a problem. Please bring water\, snacks\,
  sun screen\, a hat\, sunglasses\, and clothing suitable for the weather. 
 The bridges get very breezy.\n\nYou can learn details by visiting our webs
 ite.\n\n<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://durhamresistancehub.
 com/btfsite&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw0zG_j
 uUMfr4iBTGV5e60UH" target="_blank">https://durhamresistancehub.com/btfsite
 </a>\n\nWe will ask people to bring American flags and smaller signs if th
 ey have cars and pedestrians on the bridge. Please also bring Rainbow flag
 s\, Mexican flags\, and Palestine flags.\n\nPlease tell your friends to co
 me.\n\nPeople loved driving under bridge after bridge seeing our protector
 s up there sharing a unified message. Please be part of this next coordina
 ted event!\n\nPlease join our Substack: <a href="https://www.google.com/ur
 l?q=https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democracy&a
 mp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw3y7Kv9RwiMPWcPPUFQ
 ih9k" target="_blank">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defen
 ders-4-democracy</a>\n\nFor more ED4D Mobilize Events: <a href="https://ww
 w.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/&am
 p\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1xqNbFip0P6DfK4plFB
 1D7" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/<
 /a>\n\nHave accessibility questions? The first link above includes an inte
 ractive map of participating bridges with information on locations\, parki
 ng\, accessibility and restrooms. This will help you choose a bridge that 
 is right for you. If you have further questions\, reply to your registrati
 on email\nto confirm your requirements or request more information.\n\n<a 
 href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefenders
 fordemocracy/event/842855/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;
 usg=AOvVaw0gzPrDc81JbaMEA1Ju88o3" target="_blank">https://www.mobilize.us/
 engagedefendersfordemocracy/event/842855/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260921T003222Z
LOCATION:Bridges will vary across the Triangle\, Durham\, NC\, 27705
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
