DESCRIPTION:A concert celebrating 250 years of American History in the hear
 t of Happy Valley\, featuring performances from local artists Terry Edward
 s\, and the Shelby Rae Moore Band.\n\nDay: Saturday\, October 17th\, 2026\
 n\nTime: 4 PM to 7 PM\n\nEntry Ticket: $20 for ages 13+\, $5 for ages 12 a
 nd under.\n\nSpecial Performances by local artists Terry Edwards\, and the
  Shelby Rae Moore Band will highlight the evening.\n\nFood trucks will be 
 available on site for food.\n\nBring a chair or blanket for seating\, and 
 enjoy live music at the historic home of Major General William Lenoir.\n\n
 The winner of the America 250 Quilt Raffle will be announced between perfo
 rmances!\n\nRaffle tickets are still available for purchase in person at F
 ort Defiance\, or online here.
