DESCRIPTION:Think you know what’s hiding out there along the trails in th
 e high country? Beyond the stunning views and rocky trails of Chimney Rock
  lies a history steeped in eerie mountain myths and dark superstitions. Jo
 in us at the Smokehouse for an evening of music\, spine-chilling Appalachi
 an folklore\, local ghost stories\, and cryptid legends!\n\nAcoustic Folkl
 ore: Stories & Music with NC State Parks - The group consists of park prof
 essionals that use storytelling and music to interpret the natural and cul
 tural resources of western North Carolina.
