DESCRIPTION:Transforming Families NC: In-person in Durham - Navigating the
  Holidays ??<br><p>Meet fellow parents and caregivers raising transgender\
 , non-binary and gender diverse youth in a safe\, affirming space. We'll
  share knowledge\, experiences &amp\; concerns. Confidentiality is very i
 mportant\, as we are all at different stages of our journey.</p><p>Join u
 s on the 1st and 3rd Sunday of the month from 4:30pm to 6pm for an open an
 d honest discussion group for parents of gender creative children (child
 ’s age does not matter). </p><p>Contact Alix or Nan for more informatio
 n at: <a href="mailto:transformingfamiliesnc@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org" tar
 get="_blank">transformingfamiliesnc@<u></u>lgbtqcenterofdurham.org</a></p>
 <p>Childcare not provided at this time. Self-minding children may be prese
 nt in our small library space.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260920T210244Z
LOCATION:114 Hunt St\, Durham\, NC 27701\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
