DESCRIPTION:Road ride with pace groups from 15mph to 20+ only 20+ group is
  drop\, the rest are no drop<br><br>Team On Draft - Road Cycling<br>Join u
 s for another Monday evening ride! Please note the new time. We'll keep it
  at 6 until mid-September and then move it back a few minutes every couple
  of weeks.<br><br>The route is at [<a href="https://ridewithgps.com/routes
 /50341307%5D(https://ridewithgps.com/routes/50341307)" target="_blank">htt
 ps://ridewithgps.com/routes/50341307](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/50341
 307)</a>\, where you can observe its awesome jug-shaped first loop. It's 2
 1.5 miles with 934 feet of climbing.<br><br>As you know\, we try to ride s
 afely\, which includes safe distances in pace lines\, avoidance of half-wh
 eeling\, good communication\, and signaling of hazards and incoming traffi
 c and obeying all traffic laws.<br><br>As always\, we'll convene back at t
 he Glass Jug for beers afterward. Five-dollar pints on Mondays!<br><br>Ple
 ase sign the waiver here if you have not done so in 2026: [<a href="https:
 //docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfZ7Gz6Zi9mbhgyt4KFo2ZLCRYaYSBXijcRYa6l
