 s open to all levels of birdwatching experience. Participants are encourag
 ed to bring their own binoculars\, as supplies is limited. <a href="https
 ://anc.apm.activecommunities.com/dprplaymore/activity/search?onlineSiteId=
 0&locale=en-US&activity_select_param=2&activity_category_ids=18&activity_k
 eyword=bird&viewMode=list" target="_blank"><u>Preregistration is required<
 /u></a> for all participants.
