DESCRIPTION:Join a ranger for a guided hike to learn about the local histor
 y of the dividing line between North Carolina and Virginia! This hike comm
 emorates the 298th anniversary of William Byrd surveying the area of the S
 tate line\, found at Mayo River State Park.\n\nWe will meet at the kiosk f
 ound at the head of the trail at 1 PM on October 24th.\n\nPlease wear prop
 er hiking footwear and attire. Please bring water and snacks. \n\nThe hike
  will be approximately 1.3 miles total\, out and back.\n\nRegister via thi
 s event page or by emailing mayo.river@ncparks.gov
