DESCRIPTION:** Rated PG-13**$10 Per Person** - The Friends of Ft. Macon inv
 ite you to experience the Spooky\, Scary side of Ft. Macon as they transfo
 rm several of the casemates into a walk through “Haunted House.” This 
 event is intended to be SCARY!\, and children under the age of 13 are not 
 recommended.   This is a ticketed event $10 per person\, proceeds going to
