DTSTART:20261025T140000Z
DTEND:20261025T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 Carolina Kite Fest will be held Oct. 24-25\, at the be
 autiful Ft. Macon State Park. Flying is normally centered around the swimm
 ing beach\, which is the first parking lot on the right after you enter th
 e Fort grounds.  The Park offers large flying fields\, ample parking\, res
 t rooms\, and the opportunity to visit the best state park in North Caroli
 na. Bring your kites to fly\, and take time to meet other flyers for two d
 ays of pure kite fun. We expect flying to be best between 10 and 4 both da
 ys.  This is a free event sponsored by Kites Unlimited in the Atlantic Sta
 tion Shopping Center. \n\nAs with all Kite events\, local weather will be 
 taken into account.
GEO:34.696366;-76.684506
LOCATION:Fort Macon State Park\, Bathhouse / Beach Access Beach
SUMMARY:Carolina Kite Festival
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/carolina-kite-festival
