DESCRIPTION:Eco Cruise: Climb aboard for a guided cruise exploring the rich
  estuarine habitats around Hammocks Beach State Park. This cruise focuses 
 on the wildlife we come across. Limited to 11 participants\, sign-up is re
 quired. To register you need to sign-up at the Visitor's Center.
