DESCRIPTION:Connect with your community\, enjoy refreshments\, learn about 
 NCMA programs and resources\, check out new digital experiences from local
  organizations\, and spend time in the galleries. Time travel from ancient
  Nubia to the technologically advanced art of today by visiting exhibition
 s Nancy Baker Cahill: Ecologies of Scale and Ancient Nubia: Excavating Tre
 asures of the Nile\, from the Museum of Fine Arts\, Boston. Admission is i
 s free\, but registration required. \n\nTickets are available for 4 pm and
  5 pm slots to allow flexibility for teachers with different bell schedule
 s. Attendees can check in any time until 6:30 pm.
