  Gracie at the Pilot Creek access for a beginner-friendly bird walk to dis
 cover the birds that call Pilot Mountain State Park home. We'll take a lei
 surely walk along park trails while learning how to spot and identify comm
 on birds by sight and sound. This program is perfect for first-time birder
 s and for all ages. No experience or equipment needed\, but if you have bi
 noculars\, bring them! Please RSVP by emailing pilot.mountain@ncparks.gov.
