X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal Cb2Ajgfjpk6Bf9Gifg6Kg2Hn1S": "https://www.meetup.com/ondraft/events/314308795/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_cb2ajgfjpk6bf9gifg6kg2hn1s
SUMMARY:Haunted Hundred Weekend on Topsail Island
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261102T100000
DTSTAMP:20261003T050354Z
UID:event_314308795@meetup.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T160000
SEQUENCE:1
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260811T175133Z
DESCRIPTION:Team On Draft - Road Cycling\n**We will host a beach house wee
 kend again with the 6th Annual Haunted Hundred as the main event!** This k
 eeps getting better every year! It's much more than riding and thereâ
 s plenty for our non-riding friends to enjoy.\n\n*You do not need to parti
 cipate in the beach house or the weekend events in order to ride with us o
 n Sunday's Haunted Hundred Ride. The Haunted Hundred Ride will be posted s
 eparately.*\n\n**Friday Evening** we may hit a bar or two for some dancing
  and playing pool. Let's break the ice and get acquainted with your housem
 ates.\n\n**Saturday** after Michael prepares his famous breakfast of pumpk
 in pancakes and maple link sausage. Some folks may opt for some kayaking a
 round Permuda Island if the rental establishments are open. Many enjoy som
 e beach time. Do your own thing or do something with others\; your choice.
 \n\n**Saturday Evening** you can choose to go out to your favorite restaur
 ant or partake in the group feast (traditionally from Topsail Steamer!) at
  the beach house.\n\n**On Sunday**\, the Drafters ride with the Turtles!! 
 Everyone can regroup at the Post Ride Party at Salty's Surf Shack (be sure
  to purchase the tickets for Non-Riding Guests). Stay Sunday night and res
 t or\, if you need to head back home\, youâll have the beach house to
  freshen up for the ride back home. Our check-out will not be until Monday
  morning.\n\n**Requirements:**\n\n1\\. Please sign up for the ride on your
  own\\. Details are at Salty Turtle Cycling Club Haunted Hundred\\. There 
 are only 63 spots left\\.\n\n2\\. Contact Margaret\\-Anne to provide your 
 payment $530\\.00 for a bedroom with private bathroom in this year's beach
  house\\. We think this is a great deal for your own king or queen bed wit
 h private bathroom\\. It's 1\\.4 miles from the Surf Shack\\. If it doesn'
 t fill by July 30th\, we will cancel\, but this event has just gets bigger
  and bigger every year so please reply quickly if you want in on the house
 \\. You can find it by looking on VRBO\\. The name of the property on VRBO
  is "Oceanfront Retreat with Premium Views\, Roof Top Hot Tub\, Private Po
 ol\, Game Room and More\\.\\.\\.\\!"\n\nIf our house is at capacity\, plea
 se consider starting your rental. We can share our address and include eve
 ryone in the group fun. Just let us know.\n\nMichael & Margaret-Anne\n\n\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\nPlease see the official p
 age for the [5th Annual Haunted Hundred Bike Ride Event October 26\, 2025-
 Salty Turtle Cycling Club](https://saltyturtlecycling.raklet.com/Events/Ho
 me/Details/df44c52c-4cb4-439a-ab57-145be2d604c8) at raklet.com!\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
