DESCRIPTION:Why is the park burning and why are they wearing yellow? Join R
 anger McKenney on a hike around the park’s lake trail to learn the answe
 rs to these questions and more. Learn about why state parks prescribe cert
 ain areas of the park and get the chance to be up close and personal with 
 equipment used during wildland fires. We will meet at Shelter 4 and then t
 ake a short hike around the lake trail. Be prepared for the weather and ab
 out a mile hike. Suitable for all ages. Email mitchell.mckenney@ncparks.go
 v for more information and to sign up.
GEO:36.395044;-80.266541
LOCATION:Hanging Rock State Park\, Shelter 4
SUMMARY:Fire Ecology
