DESCRIPTION:Did you hear that? What is that?\n\nHave you ever wondered what
  creatures are making those sounds outside at night? Join a Ranger and lea
 rn about what is in the woods around you\, why they make the noises that t
 hey do and some simple identification.\n\nAll children must be accompanied
  by an adult. Please be sure to dress appropriately for the weather\, wear
  hiking shoes and bug spray\, bring water\, and a flashlight!\n\nSpaces ar
 e limited\, and registration is required. To sign up\, call (984) 250-1370
  or email eno.river@ncparks.gov. Include the number of guests in your part
 y and a phone number where you can be reached if the event is changed or c
 anceled.
GEO:36.078519;-79.005129
LOCATION:Eno River State Park - Fews Ford Access & Visitor Center\, Picnic 
 Shelter
