DESCRIPTION:Join Ranger Fields and follow old Camp Sertoma trails to some l
 esser-known hilltop graves. This hike will be roughly 3 miles long with mu
 ltiple creek crossings on uneven terrain. This hike is for the adventurous
 ! A hiking pole\, adequate hiking shoes\, and a solid flashlight/headlamp 
 are highly recommended. At the end of the hike\, we will visit the Vade Me
 cum hotel. Space will be limited. To sign up for this program\, email Jaco
 b.fields@ncparks.gov.
