DESCRIPTION:What happened when the Toxaway Dam broke? What’s underneath L
 ake Jocassee? Are there really people buried in the park?\n\nJoin a Ranger
  on a hike through history- learn about local legends\, ghost stories\, an
 d the people who lived on the land before Gorges was Gorges!\n\nBe prepare
 d for a moderate\, 60 minute hike. Candy will be available. Costumes are e
 ncouraged. Meet at the Rainbow Falls trailhead.
