UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54100219227206
DTSTART:20261031T130000Z
DTEND:20261031T204500Z
DESCRIPTION:Bats are often misunderstood because of their association with 
 Halloween and all things spooky - from their leathery wings to their cave-
 like habitats. But these fascinating animals are far more than a symbol of
  the spooky season. Bats play an important role in our ecosystems and prov
 ide valuable benefits to the natural world. Come visit our Batty Bio Blitz
  display at the Visitor Center to discover more about bat ecology\, their 
 unique adaptations\, the important roles they play in our ecosystems\, and
  how we can help conserve and protect these remarkable animals. Registrati
 on is not required. For more information or questions\, please email andra
 -claire.greene@ncparks.gov.
GEO:36.395109;-80.266444
LOCATION:Visitor Center
SUMMARY:Batty Bio Blitz 
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/batty-bio-blitz
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
