BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Discover Durham Together": "https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/316742293/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_discover_durham_together
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Discover Durham Together
UID:event_316742293@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261003T050324Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261031T223000
SUMMARY:🎃 Walk & Brew: Halloween Crawl 👻🍻
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nIt’s getting cooler out\, so Walk 
 & Brew is getting a Halloween edition!\n\nWe’ll meet at 6:30 PM at Bull 
 McCabe’s and make our way through downtown Durham\, checking out costume
 s\, grabbing drinks\, getting some walking in\, and stopping at a few fun 
 spots along the way.\n\n6:30 — Bull McCabe’s\nOur starting point. Grab
  a drink\, meet everybody\, and we’ll head out together.\n\n→ The Velv
 et Hippo\nGetting here relatively early before the rooftop gets packed. Fo
 od is available if you’re hungry.\n\n→ Queeny’s\nBasically next door
 \, so an easy second stop—and another chance to grab food.\n\n→ High D
 ive\nOne more stop as we make our way toward Five Points.\n\n≈ 9:30 — 
 Rubies on Five Points 💃🕺\nOur final destination for The Mallgoth Hor
 ror Picture Show\, their Halloween dance party. The party starts at 9 PM a
 nd there’s a $10 cover.\n\nCome in costume if you want\, but it’s defi
 nitely not required. You can drink\, not drink\, eat along the way\, leave
  whenever you want\, or stick around and dance with us at the end.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/discover-durham-together/events/31674
 2293/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260928T001838Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T001838Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/death-dying-seasonal-tour"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261003T050337Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53922986346328
DTSTART:20261031T190000Z
DTEND:20261031T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special tour exploring the place of death in the 
 early 1800s. You will walk through the steps of a wake with a trained doce
 nt who will explain to you the community's response to death\, body prepar
 ation\, the wake\, burial and stone cutting techniques. The tour includes 
 a stop in the kitchen house and ends in the cemetery where you will learn 
 the unique history behind the Polk family cemetery.\n\nThis tour is design
 ed to be family friendly and suitable for all ages. All tour fees are paid
  on site prior to the start of the tour.\n\nTour guests can expect up to a
  1/4 mile of walking along some uneven ground. Please wear appropriate sho
 es and clothing for the weather. In the event of extreme heat\, cold or ra
 in\, the tour will be cancelled.
GEO:35.078;-80.882745
LOCATION:President James K. Polk Historic Site
SUMMARY:Death & Dying Seasonal Tour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/death-dying-seasonal-tour
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Guided Tours
END:VEVENT
