UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_51225005650217
DTSTART:20261114T160000Z
DTEND:20261114T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:Hidden Battleship is for the explorer at heart! Join us for an 
 afternoon on a unique\, behind-the-scenes tour of unrestored areas on the 
 Battleship. Organized into small groups\, the participants are led to area
 s in the bow\, third deck\, and below\, and the superstructure\, including
  all the way to the very top! This program requires climbing ladders\, cro
 ssing high hatches\, and going through tight/confined spaces. The tour is 
 limited to ages 16 and older.\n\n2026 Dates\n\n► January 24\n► Februar
 y 28\n► March 28\n► April 18\n► November 14\n\n11 am – 5 pm\; $75 
 (plus tax) per participant. This program always sells out\, so get your Hi
 dden Battleship ticket now! This program is for ages 16 and older.
GEO:34.236158;-77.953643
LOCATION: Battleship North Carolina
SUMMARY:Hidden Battleship Tour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/hidden-battleship-tour
END:VEVENT
