DTSTAMP:20261003T050338Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53833779549325
DTSTART:20261114T223000Z
DTEND:20261114T234500Z
DESCRIPTION:Experience the park after dark!  Get out and take a fun and inf
 ormative hike to the ridge with Ranger Austin.  We will follow our newly b
 uilt boardwalk to the base of the dunes\, then ascend up to the ridge.  Al
 l things Jockey's Ridge will be discussed to include our natural and cultu
 ral history\, ecology\, geology\, and more.  We hope you can join us. \n\n
 If we have inclement weather\, an indoor presentation will be offered.  \n
 \nPreregistration is required.  \n\nEmail austin.paul@ncparks.gov to sign 
 up.
GEO:35.963597;-75.632255
LOCATION:Jockey's Ridge State Park - Main Access and Visitor Center\, Meet 
 at the pavilion beside the visitor center.   
SUMMARY:In the Park After Dark - Night Hike
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/in-the-park-after-dark-night
 -hike-1198
