UID:a1in9u3geviio9vl52s8umbria@google.com__20261118
SEQUENCE:3
CREATED:20251010T142226Z
DESCRIPTION:<span><p>Come join Engaged Defenders for Democracy as we meet 
 on Wednesdays from 3:30-5pm at American Tobacco Trail Bridge over I-40. Lo
 cation: AMC Streets of Southpoint 8030 Renaissance Pkwy Durham\, NC 27713.
  Parking lots are behind Southpoint Mall near the AMC theater or in the pa
 rking lot of Roses lot on Hwy 54. Go behind Southpoint Mall to the AMC the
 ater parking lot. Walk towards Hwy 40 and look for entrance to the trail. 
 It is a 4-minute walk. You also can park at Rose's\, 105 W NC. Hwy 54 2771
 3. The walk to the bridge from Roses is a 4-minute walk.</p><p>We will hav
 e a big sign. If you bring signs\, please make sure they are positive and 
 show what we are fighting for: "Freedom 4 All" "Protect Free Speech." Plea
 se bring American flags to wave as well.</p><p>See you there every Wednesd
 ay! Thanks activism warriors!</p><p>Please join our Substack:<span> </spa
 n><a href="https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-demo
 cracy">https://substack.com/profile/115484101-engaged-defenders-4-democrac
 y</a></p><p>For more ED4D Mobilize Events:<span> </span><a href="https://
 www.mobilize.us/engagedefendersfordemocracy/">https://www.mobilize.us/enga
 gedefendersfordemocracy/</a></p><p><a href="https://www.mobilize.us/engage
 defendersfordemocracy/event/842871/">https://www.mobilize.us/engagedefende
 rsfordemocracy/event/842871/</a> </p></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260306T223122Z
LOCATION:AMC Streets of Southpoint 8030 Renaissance Pkwy\, 8030 Renaissanc
 e Pkwy\, Durham\, NC\, 27713
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:Durham Resistance (In Person)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_lgbtqcenterofdurham_org_qb71v8n48d0a304sq7dtm89f84
SUMMARY:Free and Confidential HIV/STI Testing
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261118T180000
DTSTAMP:20261003T050322Z
UID:1a5ljj1gn1ceit4rk3g7o63umf_R20260708T200000@google.com__20261118
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20260629T194105Z
DESCRIPTION:Durham County’s “I Take Testing Seriously” Program (ITTS
 ) works with community partners and members alike to decrease rates of HIV
 \, Syphilis\, Hepatitis C\, Gonorrhea\, and Chlamydia. Our public health e
 ducators provide comprehensive sexual health services anywhere in Durham C
 ounty.<br><br>When folx attend testing services through the LGBTQ Center o
 f Durham\, they are able to receive: free and confidential HIV/STI screeni
 ngs\, PrEP referrals as needed\, and confidential counseling on next steps
 .<br><br>Specimens are sent to the NC State Lab  for testing where a 4<s
 up>th</sup> generation test is used.<br><br>Access to free barriers (inte
 rnal\, external) and lubrication is always readily available.<br><br>Our t
 ester can also answer questions about PrEP and provide initial steps in th
 e County's Quick Start program for PrEP. Stop in today!<br><br>Are you not
  ready to test? Stop in for an informational session.  All questions welc
 ome.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260909T205756Z
LOCATION:114 Hunt St\, Durham\, NC 27701\, USA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
