DTEND:20261120T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy memorable and impactful sessions showcasing a rich variet
 y of music and dance performances\, hands-on craft demonstrations\, and pr
 esenter sessions from past Cultural Education Days held in conjunction wit
 h the American Indian Heritage Celebration. Streamed in one convenient pac
 kage\, this event highlights diverse traditions\, art forms\, and cultural
  perspectives and includes a recently recorded conversation with an Indige
 nous fashion designer. This compilation celebrates the vibrant and transfo
 rmative experiences of Cultural Education Days. Watch the stream anytime o
 r all the time!
