UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53699962821124
DTSTART:20261121T150000Z
DTEND:20261121T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Come join us at the Richard Caswell Memorial Site for a day of 
 mustering the militia\, celebrating our own 250th birthday. The Dobbs Coun
 ty militia will conduct musket demonstrations\, cannon demonstrations\, a 
 period ration distribution. Other activities include what the civilians wo
 uld do while following the militia. Textile displays to include weaving\, 
 knitting\, and sewing as well as children's activities and a period apothe
 cary. \n\nThe event is free to the public\, but donations are excepted.\n\
 nInquiries please call: 252-526-9600 or contact us by email dave.stone@dnc
 r.nc.gov or randi.shaw@dncr.nc.gov\n\nWe look forward to seeing you there!
GEO:35.267221;-77.621613
LOCATION:Governor Richard Caswell Memorial
SUMMARY:Mustering the Militia
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/mustering-the-militia-1369
CATEGORIES:Celebrations & Commemorations
CATEGORIES:Reenactments & Living History
END:VEVENT
