DESCRIPTION:The General George Washington Chapter\, SAR and Moseley-Bright 
 Chapter\, DAR are hosting their annual commemoration of the Patriotic Serv
 ice of Richard and William Caswell. Our focus this year is the 250th Anniv
 ersary of Richard becoming the first Governor of NC. The Wreath Laying wil
 l begin at 11:00 AM. Descendants and other Patriotiic Organizations may pl
 ace a wreath prior to 10:45 and be acknowledged during the ceremony.
