DESCRIPTION:Join us at Mayo River State Park for a Beaver Moon Hike!\n\nThe
  Beaver Moon is the full moon of November and the start of a series of thr
 ee supermoons and named after the time period when beavers prepare for win
 ter. Join us on this fun experience along the Mayo Mountain trail\, an eas
 y-moderate 2 mile hike\, through the peaceful foliage before the winter se
 ason comes along.  \n\nPlease bring water\, hiking shoes\, and flashlights
 .\n\nEvent is subject to cancel due to poor weather. Please click the "I'm
  Interested" button as event will cancel when there are no registrations a
 nd recieve emails if canceled due to weather.
GEO:36.439192;-79.948638
LOCATION:Mayo River State Park - Main Access and Park Office
SUMMARY:Beaver Moon Hike
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/beaver-moon-hike
