UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_54099273316392
DTSTART:20261128T130000Z
DTEND:20261128T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the 5th annual Run the Fort Race!  Participa
 nts may run or walk\, with\nRun the East providing timing support for thos
 e interested in a timed competition.\n \nRun the Fort is an annual race at
  Fort Macon State Park in Atlantic Beach that supports\nthe Boys and Girls
  Club of the Coastal Plain.  The BGCCP is currently in a capital\ncampaign
  for a new club building in Beaufort\, and they need our help now more tha
 n\never.  The Boys and Girls Club provides a safe place for kids to go aft
 er school and\nduring the summer\, offering them tutoring\, hot meals\, an
 d a sense of community.   \n\nRegistration Fees:\n$30 – Until September 
 30\, 2026\n$40 – From October 1st-October 31st\, 2026\n$45 - November 1s
 t - Race Day\n$25 - 18 years old and under\, all dates\n\nAll registered p
 articipants will receive a Run the Fort T-shirt\, with sizes guaranteed un
 til\nNovember 1st .
GEO:34.696366;-76.684506
LOCATION:Fort Macon State Park\, Ft. Macon
SUMMARY:Run the Fort
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/run-the-fort
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Special Site Programs
CATEGORIES:Outdoor & Recreation
CATEGORIES:Outdoor Recreation (kayak\, paddle\, hikes)
END:VEVENT
