DESCRIPTION:Lace up your shoes and run with a ranger at Carolina Beach Stat
 e Park! Enjoy a casual group run on the park's trails\, with the pace and 
 distance adjusted for everyone. Beginners\, joggers\, and walkers are all 
 welcome. We will meet at the Visitor's Center at 8:00 am. The route will c
 hange monthly and will be a mix of trails and pavement. Some trails may be
  sandy or root-heavy. \n\nBring water and running shoes. Bug spray is also
  recommended. We'll run rain or shine\, but will cancel for storms or seve
 re weather. \n\nNo registration is necessary - just show up! Whether you'r
 e training for a race\, building a new habit\, or just want to see the par
 k in a new way\, we hope you'll join us!
GEO:34.045859;-77.905159
LOCATION:Carolina Beach State Park\, Meet at Visitor's Center
