UID:simmseldf4sle4434odqqhbsok_R20260906T203000@google.com__20261206
SEQUENCE:2
CREATED:20161219T180943Z
DESCRIPTION:Catch us on August 16th!<br><br> Transforming Families NC<p>M
 eet fellow parents and caregivers raising transgender\, non-binary and gen
 der diverse youth in a safe\, affirming space. We'll share knowledge\, 
 experiences\, &amp\; concerns. Confidentiality is very important\, as we a
 re all at different stages of our journey.</p><p>Join us on the 1st and 3
 rd Sunday of the month from 4:30pm to 6pm for an open and honest discussio
 n group for parents of gender creative children (child’s age does not ma
 tter). </p><p>Contact Alix or Nan for more information at: <a href="mail
 to:transformingfamiliesnc@lgbtqcenterofdurham.org" target="_blank">transfo
 rmingfamiliesnc@<u></u>lgbtqcenterofdurham.org</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260502T171550Z
LOCATION:Virtual - email for link
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:LGBTQ Center of Durham
END:VEVENT
