BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events 1 Ics": "https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/hidden-battleship-tour-8467"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_1_ics
X-SOURCE:NC Cultural Resources
DTSTAMP:20261003T050340Z
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_53453735041712
DTSTART:20270320T150000Z
DTEND:20270320T210000Z
DESCRIPTION:Offered only four times this coming year\, Hidden Battleship ta
 kes adventurous visitors beyond the traditional self-guided tour and into 
 unrestored areas of the Battleship North Carolina Memorial that are normal
 ly closed to the public. Led by experienced guides in small groups\, parti
 cipants explore spaces deep below deck\, throughout the third deck\, in th
 e bow\, and high into the Ship's superstructure—including all the way to
  the top.\n\nThe 2027 Hidden Battleship tours will be offered on:\n\nSatur
 day\, March 20Saturday\, April 24Saturday\, November 20Each tour runs from
  11:00 am to 5:00 pm. The cost is $75 per participant\, plus tax.\n\nDesig
 ned for adventurous history enthusiasts\, the six-hour experience requires
  climbing ladders\, crossing high hatches\, and navigating tight and confi
 ned spaces. For that reason\, the program is limited to participants ages 
 16 and older.\n\nBecause attendance is intentionally limited to provide a 
 safe\, behind-the-scenes experience\, Hidden Battleship consistently sells
  out well in advance. The experience has become a favorite among repeat vi
 sitors\, military history enthusiasts\, photographers\, and anyone looking
  to explore a side of the Ship that few ever have the opportunity to see.\
 n\nWhether you're searching for a memorable gift or your next great advent
 ure\, Hidden Battleship offers an unforgettable behind-the-scenes experien
 ce unlike any other.\n\nVisitors are encouraged to reserve their spots ear
 ly. Tickets and additional information are available at https://bit.ly/hid
 denbattleship
GEO:34.236158;-77.953643
LOCATION: Battleship North Carolina
SUMMARY:Hidden Battleship Tour
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.dncr.nc.gov/event/hidden-battleship-tour-8467
CATEGORIES:Education Programs
CATEGORIES:Exhibits & Tours
CATEGORIES:Guided Tours
END:VEVENT
